{
    "id":  437,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED TRIAC Dimmer Switch 630W Wall Dimmer 220V AC",
    "reference":  "1272",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLED TRIAC Dimmer 630W Wall Dimmer\u003c/strong\u003e provides smooth, precise control over the lighting intensity in LED installations. Compatible with \u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC-dimmable luminaires and drivers (Leading Edge and Trailing Edge)\u003c/strong\u003e, it delivers stable operation and continuous adjustment via a practical rotary knob.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMade from \u003cstrong\u003eflame-retardant thermoplastic\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eIP20\u003c/strong\u003e protection. Maximum power \u003cstrong\u003e630W\u003c/strong\u003e – ideal for homes, offices, shops, hotels and restaurants. Improves visual comfort and optimises energy consumption.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED TRIAC Dimmer 630W Wall Dimmer 220V AC\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLED TRIAC Dimmer 630W Wall Dimmer\u003c/strong\u003e is the ideal solution for precisely controlling lighting intensity in dimmable LED installations. Compatible with luminaires and drivers featuring \u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC phase-cut dimming\u003c/strong\u003e, it allows smooth, continuous light-level adjustment, creating the perfect ambience in any space.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMade from \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-strength flame-retardant thermoplastic\u003c/strong\u003e, it offers excellent durability and safety. Its \u003cstrong\u003eIP20\u003c/strong\u003e protection rating makes it suitable for indoor installations, delivering reliable, stable performance in homes, offices, shops and all types of professional environments.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith a dimming capacity of up to \u003cstrong\u003e630W\u003c/strong\u003e, this dimmer is compatible with a wide range of dimmable LED luminaires, letting you adapt light output to each moment’s needs – from soft, comfortable lighting for cosy atmospheres to full power for tasks requiring greater visibility. A rotary knob provides quick, intuitive control.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eApplications\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe LED TRIAC Dimmer 630W is especially suited to controlling light intensity in:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHomes and apartments.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLiving rooms, bedrooms and dining rooms.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffices and workspaces.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHotels and tourist accommodation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestaurants, cafés and bars.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShops and retail spaces.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShop windows and display cases.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eArt galleries, museums and exhibition halls.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCommercial and public-facing spaces.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey advantages\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmooth, precise light-intensity control.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with \u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC-dimmable LED luminaires and drivers\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum power \u003cstrong\u003e630W\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlush wall installation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade from \u003cstrong\u003eflame-retardant thermoplastic\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP20\u003c/strong\u003e indoor protection.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElegant design that blends into any room.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy rotary-knob operation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant:\u003c/strong\u003e For correct operation, this dimmer must only be used with luminaires or LED drivers compatible with \u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC dimming (Leading Edge or Trailing Edge)\u003c/strong\u003e. Use with non-dimmable equipment may cause malfunction or damage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt \u003cstrong\u003eFactorLED\u003c/strong\u003e we select high-quality products that comply with European standards and deliver reliable, long-lasting performance. All our products include the corresponding datasheet for professional installers, distributors and wholesalers.\u003c/p\u003e",
